  "description": "Waited 4 days for this stock to hit buy territory. It did today.",
  "body_html": "<p>Good Morning and Happy Tuesday! We had a choppy start to the week, but it appears most stocks are resuming their trend upwards. </p><h4>A couple of quick updates:</h4><ol><li><p>What’s going on with Xometry? Our biggest winner just had some news…</p></li><li><p>Market conditions and Tim’s expectations</p></li><li><p>Stock I am BUYING Now… 🛒</p></li></ol><p>Also, before we get started… I will do a video mid-week movers tomorrow, its been a while since making a video. So be sure to ❤️ re-stack 🔄 and then<strong> comment down below a stock YOU want me to review. </strong>Subscribers have priority…ill pick some non-subscribers at random. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><strong>Some helpful tips if you want me to review your ticker:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Avoid stocks with price below 200 day moving average</strong>. These always get ranked last. Immediately. You can’t time bottoms. I can’t time bottoms. And we do not fight trends. </p></li><li><p>Market cap’s greater than $2B. I may look at smaller stocks…but micro caps are much less predictable. </p></li><li><p>The less you have “heard” about it, or seen online…the better.</p></li></ul><h4>Now…what is up with Xometry?!</h4><p>We were up 38% yesterday…now we are up 14%. It is certainly a party pooper. If you did not catch the news, XMTR is doing a $225M public stock offering, an additional 2.6M shares.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> Often times (not always), this is pretty bearish short term, but bullish longer term. But, these are not drastic numbers. Roughly 4% of the market cap, and 5% of the total shares. Also, the news came during post market, during a low volume period. Personal opinion: a bit of an over-reaction to a news event. </p><p><strong>Cause of the drop:</strong> Panic about share dilution (more shares lowers value)</p><p><strong>The positive:</strong> I’m not a huge fan of J.P. Morgan or Goldman Sachs…but they are managing the offering. They wouldn’t do this offering if they thought the share prices were going to plummet on those investments in the future. </p><p><strong>My gameplan:</strong> Its not often I sprint to sell a stock, especially one in profit, due to a post-market news event. I held XMTR at $82 a few weeks ago, I am continuing to hold. I will NOT take a loss…my stop is pushed around the break even price. I’d like to see how price action stabilizes the next few days, but we shall see. Even if I get stopped out, I suspect I will find a new entry. The weekly and monthly charts still look fantastic. </p><p><strong>What should you do? </strong>Ultimately, that is up to you. You could click sell today and snag a still healthy profit. Make your gameplan now, whether it mirrors mine, or you change it up some (which is totally fine!)</p><p>You are welcome to ping me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/b7f4035d-fcb6-44e8-911b-6712dbc96cb7\">Main chat</a> with any questions during market hours.</p><h4>What about the rest of the market?</h4><p>In short, it looks really solid. We are seeing volatility contraction patterns and breakouts, occurring on multiple charts. The S&amp;P 500 hit another all time high just yesterday, indicating the broader market is trending upwards. If you are a bear, you are wrong (respectfully). The VIX continues to trend downwards, making trades easier and easier. </p><p>Someone got a bit snippy with me that “NVDA is up”…I continue to think NVDA is a terrible investment (unless you got into it a few years ago, bravo to you). But the massive egotistical commentary is really unwarranted. 215 days of excruciating price action pain, for a whopping 7% gain. That is nothing to hang on the fridge or to call Mom about. Pretty embarrassing waste of time to be honest. It takes ALOT of money to move a $5T market cap, and NVDA continues to abide by the law of diminishing returns.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png\" width=\"1374\" height=\"854\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:854,&quot;width&quot;:1374,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:222776,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/200302234?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b9S_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4dfbd095-6092-4827-9701-d7c0b9e81d2a_1374x854.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">215 days of pain. For 7%. Oooof</figcaption></figure></div><h4>Now that I shat on NVDA for the day 😂, here is a stock looking FANTASTIC! </h4><p>I <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-croissant-alert-649\">Mentioned this stock was on my watch list</a> about 4 days ago. Today, its had a nice pop upwards in the local consolidation, and is moving upwards to breakout range quickly….</p>",
